    // ── ResNet-50 bottleneck batch-BN AdamW over 4 ACCUMULATED micro-batches train step, DATA-PARALLEL over 4 replicas ──
    // Every line is pretty(verified AST node) EXCEPT the per-parameter `%arsum*`
